                                "sense_id": "2279faa9-f4bf-3920-be7d-44077542302b",
                                "text": "From this it seems clear that if Ag. fabaceus has an amygdaline odour and taste it must be in a very modified degree, as the taste and odour of the plant, as it grows here, could escape no one."
